<lb n="1r1"/><g type="ddandaOrnate">// @1 //</g>
	
<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ kāli kāla dutinarahr̥daya saśokānite nograhno|</l>
<l n="b">Aum̐ kāreḥ ghoraṇādo pralaya vita śikātāraṅ phīṅgakṣi rodra|</l>
<l n="c">hrīm̐ hraḥ tejobi pur<lb n="1r2"/>ṇne paśa dahaya <app><lem>phaṭa</lem><rdg wit="#J1"><unclear	reason="eccentric_ductus">pha</unclear>ṭā</rdg></app>pātamā
    bheravītvə|</l> 
<l n="d">hīm̐ hraḥ kaṅkāla da<del rend="ui">ra</del>:rī tribūvaṇa mata hārakṣamə; badrakāli @1</l>
</lg> 
	
<lg>
<l n="a">hā hā hī hī samūni vikr̥ta bayakarā hariṇi nilavarṇnī| </l>
<l n="b">hā<lb n="1r3"/>hā h<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">ī</unclear> hi karāli vikaṭā daśabūjāśūra rāhurūpa| </l>
<l n="c">jrām̐ jrām̐ jrīm̐ vibakṣā śava rūdira mahāmaṅśa pāli vimohī| </l>
<l n="d">hīm̐ hrāṁ kam̐ kāla dārī tribūvaṇā śūpitā rakṣamə; badrāka<lb n="1r4"/>li @2 </l></lg>

<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ kāraṇa yām̐ yām̐ carmmanetre hara hara hara Aum̐ kāraṇā destanāde|</l>
<l n="b">krūm̐ krum̐ yūm̐ yūm̐ vaśaghnīḥ vikr̥tadarasiraṁ skandatāte munande|</l>
<l n="c">glom̐ glom̐ rām̐ rām̐ la lā lā la la la la<pb n="1v"/> <!-- F.001v--><lb n="1v1"/>sahite kūlahaste praAste|</l>
<l n="d">pa<del rend="strikeout">:</del>yastā pāpaṇa seda marukaśahite rakṣamə; bādrakali <g type="ddandaOrnate">@1 vam̐ @1</g></l> 
</lg>
	
Itiḥ mantra panəhət· @1 @1

<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ ganapati mahiśorai|</l>
<l n="b">	parameṣṭī harudrañcaḥ<lb n="1v2"/>|</l>
<l n="c">catūr bujai saṅkarañcaḥ| </l>
<l n="d">trināyaṇa śambhuyañcaḥ @1 </l>
</lg>

<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ saṁ hyaṁ hyaṁ hiśorante|</l>
<l n="b">Aum̐ saṁ  hyaṁ hyaṁ parameṣṭinte|</l>
<l n="c">Aum̐ saṁ hyaṁ hyaṁ mahārudrante @2</l>
</lg>
	
<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ saṁ hyaṁ hyaṁ mahābujante|</l>
<l n="b">Aum̐ saṁ<lb n="1v3"/>hyaṁ hyaṁ saṁkarante|</l>
<l n="c">Aum̐ saṁ hyaṁ hyaṁ trinayante|</l>
<l n="d">Aum̐ saṁ hyaṁ hyaṁ śambhu namaṣ te @1</l></lg>

Itiḥ haṣṭakamantra @1 @1

<!-- 
SS: 
HAṀ HAṀ HAṀ haṁsa-haṁse, hasita iha ihe, muktaghorāṭṭahāse
KHAṀ KHAṀ KHAṀ khaḍgadhāre, tribhuvananilaye, kāli kaṅkāladhāri
RAṀ RAṀ RAṀ raṅga-raṅge, prahasitavadane, piṅgakeśi śmaśāne
VRAṀ VRIṀ VRUṀ sthāpanīye, bhr̥kuṭipaṭuphaṭāṭopaṭoṁkāravajre. 
	
J1: 
ham̐ ham̐ ham̐[SH] haṅsa haṅse hasita Iha Ihe mukti ghora:ṣṭahaṣe, 
kam̐ kam̐ kam̐ kadgada:re tribhūvaṇa nilaye ka:likaṅka:lada:ri, 
ram̐ ram̐ ram̐ raṅga raṅge prahasitava-danepiṅgakesi śmaśa:ne, 
vram̐ vrīm̐ vrum̐ stapaniye bhrukuṭi tatupaṭa:toṁṅka:ravajre
-->

<lg>
<l n="a">Aum̐ ham̐ <app><lem wit="#J1">hām̐</lem><rdg wit="#edSS">hāṁ</rdg></app> hāṅṣa haṅṣe hasita iha ihā <app><lem wit="#edSS">muktaghorāṭṭahāse</lem><rdg wit="#J1">mūktaghorraṭāhāse</rdg></app>|</l>
<l n="b"><lb n="1v4"/><app><lem wit="#edSS">kham̐ kham̐ kham̐</lem><rdg wit="#J1">kam̐ kam̐ kam̐</rdg></app><app><lem wit="#edSS">khaḍgadhāre</lem><rdg wit="#J1">ka<unclear reason="eccentric_ductus">d</unclear>kahasve</rdg></app> tribūvaṇānilaye kāli <app><lem wit="#edSS">kaṅkāladhāri</lem><rdg wit="#J1">kaṅkāladari</rdg></app>|</l> 
<l n="c">ram̐ ram̐ ram̐ raṅga raṅge <app><lem wit="#edSS">prahasitavadane</lem><rdg
			wit="#J1">prahatavadane</rdg></app> <app><lem wit="#edSS">piṅgakeśi</lem><rdg
					wit="#J1">piṅgate</rdg></app> <app><lem wit="#edSS">śmaśāne</lem><rdg wit="#J1">sarvvasāne</rdg></app>| </l>

<l n="d"><app><lem wit="#edSS">vram̐ vrim̐ vrum̐</lem><rdg wit="#J1">brām̐ bram̐
			brūm̐</rdg></app> <app><lem wit="#edSS">sthāpanīye</lem><rdg wit="#J1">svāpaniye</rdg></app><app><lem wit="#edSS">bhr̥kuṭi</lem><rdg wit="#J1">brukuṭi</rdg></app> <app><lem wit="#edSS">paṭuphaṭāṭo</lem><rdg wit="#J1">tadapaṭeṭo</rdg></app> paṭ
	<app><lem wit="#edSS">oṁkāravajre</lem><rdg wit="#J1">aṅkāragarje</rdg></app> @</l>
</lg>

